{
  "description": "Views rendered from upstream's interface by migration/scripts/gui_reference.py frames, and from the port's editor by sas-gui's gallery test, for side-by-side comparison. A preset, when given, is a path from the repository root to authored content (never a factory preset). effects_scroll scrolls the effects column down that many pixels, kept within the column. overlay opens the preset browser (\"preset_browser\") or the save section for a preset (\"save_section\") over the tab. midi (an authored file in migration/corpus/midi/) and seconds run the engine before the frame, on both sides, at 44.1 kHz and 120 BPM in 64-sample blocks; animate draws the animated views from it (it needs midi, or seconds above 0).",
